%% Query flow as deployed on 2026-10-30: a public MCP server that returns evidence.
%% No sign-in and no chat model on the server. The client's model writes the
%% answer, then sends it back to verify_figures.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as MCP client (Claude, Cursor, ...)
    participant L as Lambda (Function URL, server/main.py)
    participant DDB as DynamoDB (rate limits, tool cache, call logs)
    participant T as Tool (server/mcp_tools/*)
    participant E as evidence.find_passages
    participant BM as Keyword index (SQLite FTS5 in /tmp)
    participant OA as OpenAI (text-embedding-3-small)
    participant PC as Pinecone (finrag-filings, 1536-dim)
    participant VY as Voyage AI (rerank-2.5)

    C->>L: POST /mcp tools/call search_sec_filings(question, ticker?, fiscal_year?)
    Note over L,BM: cold start only: download the ~964 MB index to /tmp.<br/>initialize and tools/list never load it.
    L->>T: run_tool (one guard for all six tools)
    T->>DDB: UpdateItem rate limit (30 a minute, 1,000 a day, shared)
    alt over the limit
        T-->>C: tool error with retry-after
    end
    T->>DDB: GetItem tool cache (24 h)
    alt cache hit
        T-->>C: cached passages
    end

    T->>E: find_passages(question)
    E->>E: clean the question, pull ticker + years from the user's own words,<br/>add GAAP line-item wording ("capex" -> "purchases of property, plant and equipment")
    par hybrid retrieval, both filtered to ticker + period window
        E->>BM: FTS5 MATCH ... ORDER BY bm25() (top 40)
        BM-->>E: keyword hits
    and
        E->>OA: embed(question)
        OA-->>E: vector
        E->>PC: query(vector, top_k=40, filter)
        PC-->>E: semantic hits (text cut to 1,000 chars)
    end
    alt embedding fails
        E->>BM: keyword search only, with a note telling the client
    end
    E->>BM: chunk_lookup: swap every candidate for its full text
    E->>E: fiscal-year question: drop 10-Qs when a 10-K was found
    E->>VY: Voyage rerank-2.5, keep top 5 (word-overlap scorer if Voyage fails)
    E-->>T: passages + note
    T->>DDB: PutItem tool cache (clean results only) + call log (90-day expiry)
    T-->>C: passages [{id, citation, text}]

    C->>C: the client's model writes the answer, citing each figure
    C->>L: tools/call verify_figures(answer, passage_ids)
    L->>T: run_tool
    T->>BM: fetch the cited passages by id
    T->>T: parse every number in the answer, compare by magnitude
    T-->>C: {grounded: [...], not_found: [...]}
